These scripts are copied verbatim from docker-library/php and are covered by
../LICENSE-docker-library-php (MIT). Do not edit them here; update them from
upstream so the base images keep the same behavior as the official php images.

Repository: https://github.com/docker-library/php
Commit:     5ec2a6a0dad498e89a91a39454dbb52e98ce2bdb (2026-10-21)

Files:
  docker-php-entrypoint
  docker-php-ext-configure
  docker-php-ext-enable
  docker-php-ext-install
  docker-php-source

To update:
  git clone https://github.com/docker-library/php /tmp/docker-library-php
  for f in docker-php-entrypoint docker-php-ext-configure docker-php-ext-enable docker-php-ext-install docker-php-source; do
    cp /tmp/docker-library-php/$f src/base/bin/$f
  done
  git -C /tmp/docker-library-php log -1 --format='%H (%cs)'   # record it above
